5. Image architecture

The project uses a central image registry:

src/data/images.js

Physical image files belong in:

public/images/

Rule

One physical image = one file.

Components reference images through the registry instead of scattering file paths throughout the application.

Example:

export const images = {
  heroProductUI: '/images/hero-product-ui.svg',
  featureAutomationPreview: '/images/feature-automation-preview.svg',
}

Image roles

Product preview images should represent the SaaS product itself:

dashboard

workflow automation

analytics

security controls

solution-specific product views

Real photography is most useful for:

About/team

company story

selected human/workspace sections

Trust/logo marks should remain logo assets rather than photography.

