7. Client editing rules

Normal client edits should be limited to the data/configuration layer and image assets.

Main editable files

src/data/site.js
src/data/images.js
public/images/*

Most copy changes should be made through the relevant data files where the project exposes them.

Avoid directly editing component logic for ordinary content changes.

