10. Important limitation of the static contact form

This V1 does not store enquiries in a database and does not send email from the server.

For a later production application where leads must be captured automatically, add a real form backend/service such as:

a server endpoint

a transactional email provider

a form service

That should be treated as a future production enhancement rather than silently pretending the static site already has that capability.

